109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 70 0 R
/T (The system uses machine learning \(Random Forest, XGBoost\) on validated project data to predict delay probability and delay duration at each land-acquisition stage. Explainable AI \(SHAP\) reveals the key factors driving each risk score, while a What-If Simulation Engine lets officials test interventions and see the projected risk reduction instantly. A GIS-based dashboard with automated alerts visualizes high-risk projects for quick action, and a recommendation engine suggests corrective steps , keeping humans in control of all final decisions. This shifts governance from reactive to predictive to preventive.)
/E (The system uses machine learning \(Random Forest, XGBoost\) on validated project data to predict delay probability and delay duration at each land-acquisition stage. Explainable AI \(SHAP\) reveals the key factors driving each risk score, while a What-If Simulation Engine lets officials test interventions and see the projected risk reduction instantly. A GIS-based dashboard with automated alerts visualizes high-risk projects for quick action, and a recommendation engine suggests corrective steps , keeping humans in control of all final decisions. This shifts governance from reactive to predictive to preventive.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
