/Title (The system uses machine learning \(Random Forest, XGBoost\) on validated project data to predict delay probability and delay duration at each land-acquisition stage. Explainable AI \(SHAP\) reveals the key factors driving each risk score, while a What-If Simulation Engine lets officials test interventions and see the projected risk reduction instantly. A GIS-based dashboard with automated alerts visualizes high-risk projects for quick action, and a recommendation engine suggests corrective steps , keeping humans in control of all final decisions. This shifts governance from reactive to predictive to preventive.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 453 0 R
/Next 599 0 R
>>
endobj
542 0 obj
<<
/Title (What-If Simulator : lets officers test interventions and see risk recalculate live, turning the tool from a passive dashboard into an active decision-making engine.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 453 0 R
/Prev 599 0 R
>>
endobj
